    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/23-saint-johns-court-kilmore-road-artane-dublin-d05-a6n9\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 23 Saint John’s Court, Artane.\r\n\r\nNestled at 23 Saint John’s Court on Kilmore Road, this charming end-of-terrace property effortlessly combines comfort and functionality. The exterior is well-kept and a driveway for convenient parking. The brick facade and classic design hint at the meticulous care invested in both structure and style.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the home, you are greeted by a spacious living area featuring large windows that bathe the room in natural light. This inviting space is ideal for leisure and relaxation. Adjacent is a modern kitchen equipped with sleek cabinetry and ample counter space, seamlessly connecting to a cosy dining area, perfect for family meals. The ground floor layout is enhanced by patio doors leading to a private garden, offering an excellent outdoor entertaining space or a serene personal retreat.\r\n\r\nThe property boasts three generously sized bedrooms. One bedroom is complemented by an ensuite bathroom, offering added privacy and convenience. Each bedroom contains ample natural light and space, ideal for family living or guest accommodation. There is also a well-appointed family bathroom along with an additional conveniently placed guest WC on the ground floor.\r\n\r\nLocated in the heart of Artane, the property benefits from a range of nearby amenities. Local schools and sports clubs are within easy reach, making it a practical choice for families. Public transport options are conveniently available, with a bus stop just a short stroll away, providing seamless connectivity to central Dublin. The surrounding area also offers various shopping and dining options, enhancing the convenience of the location.\r\n\r\nThis property presents a superb opportunity for first-time buyers looking for a welcoming home, those upgrading to a larger space, or investors seeking a valuable addition to their portfolio. Its practical layout, combined with its excellent location, makes it a notable choice for a variety of potential owners."
